  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: Used in an observation to express that the observation is an indicator of a person's enrollment in hospice or palliative care services.),(Data Element Scope: Observation.code where observation.value is true or false and observation.effectivetTime is a point in time or a span of time when the indicator (i.e. enrolled in hospice care or enrolled in palliative care) is true.),(Inclusion Criteria: concepts that assert enrollment in hospice care or palliative care or a specific type of hospice or palliative care.),(Exclusion Criteria: )",
